            "review_title": "Review at Sweet & Salt Factory",
            "review_text": "Noah\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam65 contributions\n0\nNot so bad!\nOct 2023 • Friends\nSpecial offer for Birthday in Month has caused my eyes. So I quickly made a reservation.\nHard to find the location. They share the parking lot with the coffee across the main street, but I was carrying a bag and it's rainning cats and dogs, I feel so tired and unsecurity just at the first moment. Almost want to find a new place to dine in.\nWe chose caesar salad, cheese baked pesto prawn pasta, and a combo of three kinds of steak. Thanks God everything are as good as my expectations. They also gave us a chocolate crepe for dessert, because our bill was over 500k, and that's super delicious.\nMaybe I'll come back.\nRead more\nWritten October 5, 2023",
