            "review_title": "Review at Sweet & Salt Factory",
            "review_text": "April Honeysuckle\nSan Diego, California55 contributions\n0\nWhen You’ve Had Enough Pho\nSep 2019 • Couples\nMy husband, a carnivore, and I dropped in for lunch. The prime rib was very delicious by itself even though we asked for teriyaki and peppercorn sauces on the side. Also delicious was the fried calamari. A list of about 8 ice creams were posted on a board when only 2 were available. The mango ice cream we ordered was refreshingly delicious. The hosts were exceptionally attentive and were always smiling.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 28, 2019",
