            "review_title": "Review at Sweet & Salt Factory",
            "review_text": "Hiro\n136 contributions\n1\nNo Frills, Great Cosy Steakhouse\nAug 2019 • Friends\nIt's a hidden cosy steakhouse in D1. Wagyu zabuton was so tender and great as it was. No sauce needed. And available at less than $10 for 100g, so it's a no-brainer to me. \nI also tried their himemade icecream. Mango flavour was so freshing. It's a must-try too. Their steaks are available on Foody too, so I will definitely order online sometimes.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 29, 2019",
